        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Stainless Steel 05-S7 Square Knob with Matching 100-S7 Square Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Square Stainless Steel Entryset comes packaged with a single cylinder deadbolt and a passage knob. The unique square shape is an eye-catcher--sure to instantly let people know your personal style. While there are plenty of knobs with square rosettes out there, their are few that have a square knob to match, let alone a square deadbolt too! The sharp angles of this stainless steel entry set makes it great for ultra-modern spaces. We picture this as the first thing big clients see as they enter your chic office. Or imagine this knob and lock set in your home, bringing out the modern stainless steel accents throughout your space. It is available in Brushed Stainless Steel and Polished Stainless Steel finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Single Cylinder Entryset with Square Knob and Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" throw bolt with Interior roll pins.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass Schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Cycle tested to ANSI standards.</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” knob spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly of knobset with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n<li>Includes passage function door knobset and single cylinder deadbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion Stainless Steel 05-S7 Knob and 100-S7 Deadbolt Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Knob Length: 2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b> is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior while the <b>Passage Knob Set</b> latch operates from either side of door by using a spindle.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is  discontinued. .</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
